     <p class="p">* Some of the locations are enabled only based on requests in the new regional clouds. To add missing locations in any regional cloud, raise a support ticket with the list of required locations.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section" id="SaaSDomainsandIPRanges-SyntheticHostedAgentssynthetic-hosted-agents--en__SaaSDomainsandIPRanges-HostedAgentCoverageVariations">
     <h3 class="title sectiontitle" id="hosted-agent-coverage-variations-0">Hosted Agent Coverage Variations</h3>
     <p class="p">Synthetic hosted agents have the following coverage variations:</p>
     <ul class="ul">
      <li class="li">The US EUM cloud has access to both AWS and Azure locations.</li>
      <li class="li">The Frankfurt EUM cloud has access to only AWS locations.</li>
      <li class="li">The Sydney EUM cloud has access to only AWS locations.</li>
      <li class="li">The Bombay EUM cloud has access to only AWS locations.</li>
      <li class="li">The GRU EUM cloud has access to only AWS locations.</li>
     </ul>
    </section>
   </div>
  </article>
  <article class="topic reference nested1" id="Smartlook_IP--en" aria-labelledby="ariaid-title6">
   <h2 class="title topictitle2" id="ariaid-title6">Smartlook</h2>
   <div class="body refbody">
    <section class="section">
     <p class="p">Ensure that you add the following IP addresses of Smartlook in your whitelist:</p>
     <ul class="ul">
      <li class="li">
       <p class="p">US Region: 52.39.171.210</p>
      </li>
      <li class="li">
       <p class="p">EU Region: 52.59.31.101</p>
      </li>
     </ul>
    </section>
   </div>
  </article>
 </article>
</main>	</div>


